round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth Bonecloak</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>     <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"3D_Preview\"> 3D Preview </span></h2>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://faeruncolors.com/#dye=orange\">Full-screen 3D model preview</a> on <i>FaerûnColors</i>\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><details class=\"bg3wiki-dye-preview\"><summary><span>Embed 3D model preview</span></summary>\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\" width=\"280\" height=\"500\" style=\"border:none\" src=\"https://faeruncolors.com/embed/orange?compact\" title=\"Orange 3D preview\"></iframe></details> \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212803\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2125/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33937/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argume